Notebook[
 {
  Cell[
   CellGroupData[
    {
     Cell[
      "Kalman Filtering vs. ARMA Models for Stock Trend Extraction and Future Price Prediction",
      "Title"
     ],
     Cell[
      "A Rigorous Comparative Framework in Wolfram Language: Trend Derivation, Out-of-Sample Forecasting, and Rolling Walk-Forward Backtesting. ",
      "Text"
     ],
     Cell[
      CellGroupData[
       {
        Cell[
         "1. Executive Summary and Theoretical Framework",
         "Section"
        ],
        Cell[
         "Predicting future stock prices and extracting dynamic trends are two foundational problems in quantitative finance. Two distinct mathematical paradigms are commonly employed:",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "1. Autoregressive Moving Average (ARMA) Models: Rooted in classical econometric time series analysis (Box-Jenkins methodology), ARMA models capture stationary autocorrelation structures in returns and project them forward toward the unconditional long-term drift rate.",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         "2. Kalman Filtering and State-Space Models: Rooted in control theory and Bayesian dynamic linear models, Kalman filters estimate unobserved hidden states (the true trend level and instantaneous momentum/drift) from noisy sequential observations, updating estimates recursively with optimal Bayesian variance reduction. ",
         "Text"
        ],
        Cell[
         CellGroupData[
          {
           Cell["Research Objective", "Subsection"],
           Cell[
            "How accurately can ARMA models and Kalman Filter trend models predict the expected future price of a stock (specifically, the expected average price over an investment horizon, such as a 20-day trading month)? ",
            "Text"
           ]
          },
          Open
         ]
        ],
        Cell[
         CellGroupData[
          {
           Cell["Mathematical Specification", "Subsection"],
           Cell[
            CellGroupData[
             {
              Cell[
               "(A) The ARMA Process on Stock Returns",
               "Subsubsection"
              ],
              Cell[
               TextData[
                {
                 "Stock price levels ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        SubscriptBox[
                         StyleBox["P", FontSlant -> "Italic"],
                         StyleBox["t", "TI"]
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "\\mathit{P}_t",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 " are non-stationary ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[{StyleBox["I", "TI"], "(", "1", ")"}],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "I(1)",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 " processes. Direct ARMA estimation on raw prices often fails or yields explosive roots (",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[{"|", "\[Phi]", "|", "\[GreaterEqual]", "1"}],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "|\\phi| \\ge 1",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 "). We therefore model stationary continuously compounded log returns: ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          SubscriptBox[StyleBox["r", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                          "\[LongEqual]",
                          "ln",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            "(",
                            RowBox[
                             {
                              SubscriptBox[StyleBox["P", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                              "/",
                              SubscriptBox[
                               StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                               RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}]
                              ]
                             }
                            ],
                            ")"
                           }
                          ],
                          "\[LongEqual]",
                          "ln",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            "(",
                            SubscriptBox[StyleBox["P", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                            ")"
                           }
                          ],
                          "-",
                          "ln",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            "(",
                            SubscriptBox[
                             StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                             RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", "1"}]
                            ],
                            ")"
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "r_t = \\ln(P_t / P_{t-1}) = \\ln(P_t) - \\ln(P_{t-1})",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 ". An ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "ARMA",
                          "(",
                          RowBox[{StyleBox["p", "TI"], ",", StyleBox["q", "TI"]}],
                          ")"
                         }
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "\\text{ARMA}(p, q)",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 " process for returns is defined as: ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          SubscriptBox[StyleBox["r", "TI"], StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                          "\[LongEqual]",
                          StyleBox["c", "TI"],
                          "+",
                          UnderoverscriptBox[
                           "\[Sum]",
                           RowBox[{StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}],
                           StyleBox["p", "TI"],
                           LimitsPositioning -> True
                          ],
                          SubscriptBox["\[Phi]", StyleBox["i", "TI"]],
                          SubscriptBox[
                           StyleBox["r", "TI"],
                           RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", StyleBox["i", "TI"]}]
                          ],
                          "+",
                          SubscriptBox["\[Epsilon]", StyleBox["t", "TI"]],
                          "+",
                          UnderoverscriptBox[
                           "\[Sum]",
                           RowBox[{StyleBox["j", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}],
                           StyleBox["q", "TI"],
                           LimitsPositioning -> True
                          ],
                          SubscriptBox["\[Theta]", StyleBox["j", "TI"]],
                          SubscriptBox[
                           "\[Epsilon]",
                           RowBox[{StyleBox["t", "TI"], "-", StyleBox["j", "TI"]}]
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "r_t = c + \\sum_{i=1}^{p} \\phi_i r_{t-i} + \\varepsilon_t + \\sum_{j=1}^{q} \\theta_j \\varepsilon_{t-j}",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 ". \nGiven multi-step forecasted returns ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          "{",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            SubscriptBox[
                             StyleBox["r", "TI"],
                             RowBox[{StyleBox["T", "TI"], "+", "1"}]
                            ],
                            ",",
                            "\[Ellipsis]",
                            ",",
                            SubscriptBox[
                             StyleBox["r", "TI"],
                             RowBox[{StyleBox["T", "TI"], "+", StyleBox["H", "TI"]}]
                            ]
                           }
                          ],
                          "}"
                         }
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "\\{r_{T+1}, \\dots, r_{T+H}\\}",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 ", the reconstructed future price trajectory is: ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          SubscriptBox[
                           StyleBox["P", "TI"],
                           RowBox[{StyleBox["T", "TI"], "+", StyleBox["h", "TI"]}]
                          ],
                          "\[LongEqual]",
                          SubscriptBox[StyleBox["P", "TI"], StyleBox["T", "TI"]],
                          "exp",
                          RowBox[
                           {
                            "(",
                            RowBox[
                             {
                              UnderoverscriptBox[
                               "\[Sum]",
                               RowBox[{StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}],
                               StyleBox["h", "TI"],
                               LimitsPositioning -> True
                              ],
                              SubscriptBox[
                               StyleBox["r", "TI"],
                               RowBox[{StyleBox["T", "TI"], "+", StyleBox["i", "TI"]}]
                              ]
                             }
                            ],
                            ")"
                           }
                          ]
                         }
                        ],
                        TraditionalForm
                       ],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "P_{T+h} = P_T \\exp\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^{h} r_{T+i}\\right)",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 " \nThe expected average future price over horizon ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" -> FormBox[StyleBox["H", "TI"], TraditionalForm],
                      "errors" -> { },
                      "input" -> "H",
                      "state" -> "Boxes"
                     |>,
                     "TeXAssistantTemplate"
                    ],
                    TraditionalForm
                   ]
                  ]
                 ],
                 " is: ",
                 Cell[
                  BoxData[
                   FormBox[
                    TemplateBox[
                     <|
                      "boxes" ->
                       FormBox[
                        RowBox[
                         {
                          SubscriptBox[
                           OverscriptBox[StyleBox["P", "TI"], "_"],
                           "ARMA"
                          ],
                          "\[LongEqual]",
                          FractionBox["1", StyleBox["H", "TI"]],
                          UnderoverscriptBox[
                           "\[Sum]",
